{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963320/extras/c546cb2f314d43d68ee95f03e53823d2.avif?t=1773299309\" width=616 height=232 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963320/extras/a5e3d646ab018a64e651e5a58598d966.webp?t=1773299309\" width=200 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To execute her command \u201cBring Mankind happiness,\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robot Rurumu hopes she can understand the &quot;Happiness of Mankind&quot; by becoming more human-like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When she fights to protect Noruru Village,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she is on the journey of finding her \u201cFighting Style.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963320/extras/90c01b82ce47fe7c73b463fd2e12cfeb.poster.avif?t=1773299309\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963320/extras/90c01b82ce47fe7c73b463fd2e12cfeb.webm?t=1773299309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963320/extras/90c01b82ce47fe7c73b463fd2e12cfeb.mp4?t=1773299309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963320/extras/f7430bed5e38a4ebf8771a6cc969c933.webp?t=1773299309\" width=200 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963320/extras/652b31f82a91edd73ad9cb618b8edd2d.avif?t=1773299309\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rurumu</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Core Awakened Maid Robot</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Rurumu has the desire to \u201cLive happily ever after with the Village Head,\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >her core awakened and she became conscious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, that hindered her pursuit of the \u201cHappiness of Mankind.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve her goal, she hopes she can become human-like one day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, in one incident, the Village Head was in danger,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >even though they avoided the tragedy, she found out her incompetency in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She then set her goal to &quot;Protect the Village.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963320/extras/9fef4f340b62613c6ef1d03a5236c11d.avif?t=1773299309\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kitsunetsuki Koharu</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A War Shrine Maiden from Demon Slayer Institution</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demons haunt mankind all over the world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but because of Demon Slayer Institution's active engagement,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >regular people are not threatened by demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kitsunestsuki Koharu has been trained to become a War Shrine Maiden since she was young,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >her success is unparalleled among her peers, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but she has ended more corrupted shrine maidens than demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her mind is tortured by having to kill her corrupted friends in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the battle against demons goes on....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIf only I could become a heartless demon-slaying robot one day.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koharu thought to herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963320/extras/ce217a3bc0ba3c2ee84771c41b7cac4d.webp?t=1773299309\" width=200 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a side-scroller action game,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters can switch between different fighting styles that have respective features,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your style tactically to counter various situations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During missions, there are a variety of enemies and treasures,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >finish mission challenges and aim for the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two playable characters,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each has unique fighting styles and enhancements,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there are also RPG elements such as equipment and equipment upgrades!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2963320?t=1773299309","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773299309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963320/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773299309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963320/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773299309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":29675