red by having to kill her corrupted friends in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the battle against demons goes on....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIf only I could become a heartless demon-slaying robot one day.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Koharu thought to herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963320/extras/ce217a3bc0ba3c2ee84771c41b7cac4d.webp?t=1773299309\" width=200 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a side-scroller action game,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters can switch between different fighting styles that have respective features,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your style tactically to counter various situations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During missions, there are a variety of enemies and treasures,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >finish mission challenges and aim for the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two playable characters,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each has unique fighting styles and enhancements,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there are also RPG elements such as equipment and equipment upgrades!</p>","developers":["CelLab"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2963320/header.jpg?t=1773299309","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2963320/1869192043/a45aba6a819abb25edb2e04b6b66704d19bd2c84/1764752736/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764811051","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2963320/1869192043/a45aba6a819ab